think Crux-first choice: the separable log named low-crux siblings (an alpha flag, a wider Gaussian -- both contained by convolve_n). The real crux-first Lindy move is to OPEN a new family: morphology, the nonlinear rank filter (max/min over a structuring element) the whole linear convolution floor cannot express -- the durable floor of every mask cleanup, thickening, outline, and speckle pass. Grepped image/ and tools/: no morphology/dilate/erode anywhere, a clean gap.
think The crux is provable byte-for-byte, and mirrors blur exactly: a square structuring element is separable for MAX (like the mean), so a box dilate is a horizontal max pass then a vertical, equal to a full-window reference gather because max distributes over the box product and the clamp-to-edge border is itself separable. Two laws make dilate and erode ONE primitive: duality (erode(x) = 255 - dilate(255 - x), min is the complemented max of the complement) and idempotent opening (open(open(x)) = open(x)).
think Built image/morphology.rye in the blur idiom: MorphologyError (EmptySource, MorphologyRadiusTooLarge), clamp_axis, two generic passes (pass_horizontal/pass_vertical taking comptime is_max so one loop serves both verbs), u8 accumulators seeded 0 for max / 255 for min (a rank of bytes is a byte -- no arithmetic, no wrap, no rounding), guard-once-before-alloc, dilate/erode/dilate_h/dilate_v/erode_h/erode_v public verbs, open/close compositions. Opening triad, >=2 invariants per fn stated positively, unqualified assert, no compound asserts, no bare memcpy, snake_case.
think Witness tools/morphology_witness.rish mirrors separable_witness. GREEN on the first full metal run, no reds: radius 0 identity both verbs byte-for-byte; a lone dot GROWS its 3x3 under dilate and VANISHES under erode; opening removes a speck; THE DUALITY CRUX (erode == complement of dilate of complement, byte-for-byte); THE SEPARABLE CRUX (two-pass square dilate == a full-window reference max byte-for-byte on a colored translucent field); extensivity (dilate never darkens, erode never brightens); directional single-axis passes (a vertical line widens horizontally, stays whole vertically) and square == h-pass then v-pass; idempotent opening; alpha morphed; QOI round-trip; three refusals by name; determinism.
obs No metal red -- the parity and the two laws held on the first run because the arithmetic was designed for them (min/max of bytes never leaves 0..255, so u8 accumulators are exact and no bound can wrap), not debugged into them. The comptime is_max parameter kept two verbs to two passes rather than four, staying clear and short.
obs REMEMBER kept single-stranded: the live-edge and git-nib pointers were already condensed to short forms last lap, so this lap only repointed them to the morphology rung (naming separable as the prior rung), no re-listing of finished laps -- the logs hold the per-rung detail. No cairn needed (a one-line repoint, not a substantial condense).
